{"step_index":963,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T03:00:10Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T22:00:10-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T22:00:10-05:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK/work/text/mission_text_report.txt`\nTotal Lines: 374\nTotal Bytes: 47435\nShowing lines 40 to 85\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n40:        CTI_PIL_RD_SH_DESC: One of the packages from Donnie's botched delivery is sending a signal near a fishing spot in Hamlet.\r\n41:   13 COM_KBOS_PLNDATE       'Down to Earth'\r\n42:        PROG_COM_KBOS_PLNDATE_DESC_REPLAY: Jason takes Lucia on a smuggling run in Brian's seaplane, but they run into trouble with the Brian's new suppliers. After dropping off the packages from the plane, Lucia realizes she's missed calls from her P.O. She and Jason get back home just in time.\r\n43:        COM_KBOS_PLNDATE_DESC: Take Brian's seaplane and pick up his package, then deliver the contents to his buyers.\r\n44:   14 INT_PLNSH              'Clear Skies'\r\n45:        PROG_INT_PLNSH_DESC_REPLAY: After escorting a smuggler plane into Leonida under the radar for Brian, Donnie convinces Jason to make an unscheduled stop so he can sell some stolen product to a local biker gang. Donnie's plan goes badly wrong but Jason gets them out alive.\r\n46:        INT_PLNSH_DESC: Head out with Donnie and help him with another job for Brian.\r\n47:   15 BIL_FUN                'Day Release'\r\n48:        PROG_BIL_FUN_DESC_REPLAY: Mattia meets Jason and Lucia at the Rusty Anchor and one of his men removes Lucia's ankle tag. They head out to hook up with Kat and a bunch of Mattia's friends on a yacht in Vice City before moving onto Club NINE1NINE. The morning after, Mattia offers them a well-paid job collecting a bag from a locker in the Grassrivers Visitor Centre, but Jason is skeptical.\r\n49:        BIL_FUN_DESC: Mattia and Kat know how to have a good time, and Lucia is ready to blow off some steam.\r\n50:   16 INT_AIR                'Swamped'\r\n51:        PROG_INT_AIR_DESC_REPLAY: Jason joins Brian and Lori to resolve Donnie's conflict with the Kingfishers. The meeting is a setup. Jason finds Donnie's body and in the ensuing gunfight Lori is taken hostage. Brian and Jason give chase across the Grassrivers, saving Lori. Brian announces his retirement from the smuggling game. Jason debates telling Lucia.\r\n52:        INT_AIR_DESC: Go with Brian and Lori to meet the Kingfishers and end their beef with Donnie.\r\n53:   17 COM_KBOS_CLEAN         'Don Gone'\r\n54:        PROG_COM_KBOS_CLEAN_DESC_REPLAY: With Donnie dead, Brian asks Jason to visit Donnie's trailer and make it look like he skipped town.\r\n55:        COM_KBOS_CLEAN_DESC: Clean up Donnie's trailer by removing any evidence of his connection to Brian.\r\n56:   18 HO_PAR_KEYCO           'Recalibration'\r\n57:        PROG_HO_PAR_KEYCO_DESC_REPLAY: Cal is depressed after Donnie's death. Jason and Lucia take him fishing to cheer him up and pay their respects to their fallen friend.\r\n58:        HO_PAR_KEYCO_DESC: Take Cal fishing to help him clear his head after Donnie's death.\r\n59:   19 BIL_PICK               'Tourist Trap'\r\n60:        PROG_BIL_PICK_DESC_REPLAY: Mattia says the pick-up job is on. Jason and Lucia, disguised as Mattia and Kat, take the bag out of a locker at the Grassriver Visitor Center, but are quickly arrested. Everyone is then attacked by dirty cops and Jason is badly wounded. They manage to get out with the bag and Cal takes Jason to hospital.\r\n61:        BIL_PICK_DESC: Follow Mattia's instructions and make the pick-up from Grassrivers Visitor Center.\r\n62:   20 BIL_HOUSE              'Home Sweet Home'\r\n63:        PROG_BIL_HOUSE_DESC_REPLAY: With Jason on his way to hospital, Lucia returns home to grab his stash, but is attacked by masked men searching for the bag from the locker. She escapes but their house is burnt down.\r\n64:        BIL_HOUSE_DESC: Collect some of Jason's belongings before the two of you skip town.\r\n65:   21 BIL_WHEEL              'Discharge Time'\r\n66:        PROG_BIL_WHEEL_DESC_REPLAY: Lucia rushes to see Jason in Vice City Hospital, but the dirty cops and masked men are there and want them dead. They fight their way out of the building and flee west to Kelly County.\r\n67:        BIL_WHEEL_DESC: Get Jason to safety before whoever torched the house tracks him down.\r\n68: == missions_chapter_2\r\n69:    0 MTL_WAKE               \"What's in the Bag?\"\r\n70:        PROG_MTL_WAKE_DESC_REPLAY: Jason wakes up in a Port Gellhorn motel room Lucia has checked them into. The dirty cop from the Visitor Center, Captain Méndez, is on the news blaming them for the attack. They look in the bag they took from the locker and see it contains an old statue and a hard drive.\r\n71:        MTL_WAKE_DESC: Examine the contents of the bag from the Visitor Center.\r\n72:    1 MTL_AMBUL              'Ambulance Chaser'\r\n73:        PROG_MTL_AMBUL_DESC_REPLAY: Lucia goes to get rid of the ambulance she used to flee the hospital and interrupts a gang trying to steal it.\r\n74:        MTL_AMBUL_DESC: Chase down the ambulance and make sure it's destroyed.\r\n75:    2 FT_MOTEL_SHOP          'Just Moved In' (label PROG_FT_MOTEL_SHOP; own-ID text: 'Just Moved In')\r\n76:        PROG_FT_MOTEL_SHOP: Just Moved In\r\n77:        PROG_FT_MOTEL_SHOP_DESC_REPLAY: With Jason out of commission, Lucia picks up some supplies from a gas station near the motel.\r\n78:        FT_MOTEL_SHOP_DESC: Pick up some supplies from the Alpha convenience store near the motel.\r\n79:    3 MTL_DRIVE              \"Girls' Trip\"\r\n80:        PROG_MTL_DRIVE_DESC_REPLAY: Jason is suffering from his gunshot wound and needs painkillers. After asking around the motel, Lucia meets Vicki, a dancer at Delights Caberet, who can help. Vicki shows Lucia round Port Gellhorn and introduces her to Dunk, a local dealer and user, who says he can get them what they need.\r\n81:        MTL_DRIVE_DESC: Help Vicki track down some painkillers to ease Jason's recovery.\r\n82:    4 COM_MECH_INTR          'Moses'\r\n83:        PROG_COM_MECH_INTR_DESC_REPLAY: Lucia meets local mechanic, Moses Watkins, who gives her a slim jim and says he'll fence any untracked cars she brings to him.\r\n84:        COM_MECH_INTR_DESC: Vicki said a mechanic named Moses could set you up with a ride. Take a low-key vehicle to his auto shop.\r\n85:    5 CTI_MECH_STFC          'Daily Driver'\r\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
