yle and securing legal immunity.\n240:   - **Stage 2: Syndicate Operations (M76–M82)**: Harbor smuggling, blackmail photography, fitness front extortion, and body sanitization.\n241:   - **Stage 3: Dre'Quan Climax & Airport Recon (M83–M91)**: Celebrity protection, kidnapping, Dre'Quan concert finale (*Headliners*), and VCIA airport perimeter surveillance.\n242:   - **Stage 4: Airport Heist & Evacuation (M92–M95)**: Cargo infiltration (*Fully Catered*), the massive airport heist (*VCIA Takedown*), open-world lockdown (*Sunset*), and emergency evacuation (*Starting From Zero*).\n243: - **POINT OF NO RETURN**: *\"Sunset\"* permanently locks open-world activities and free roam saves, forcing continuous progression into Chapter 5.\n244: \n245: ```mermaid\n246: flowchart TD\n247:     C3_Trans[\"From Ch. 3: The Cartel Heist\"] --> S1_Start\n248:     \n249:     subgraph C4_S1[\"Stage 1: Beachhead & $75k Gate (M71 - M75)\"]\n250:         S1_Start[\"71. Ocean Beach<br/>(Y Hotel Safehouse)\"] --> M72[\"72. Another Life\"]\n251:         M72 --> M73[\"73. Company Cars\"]\n252:         M73 --> M74[\"74. Lawyer Up<br/>(Abe Gonzalez Consultation)\"]\n253:         M74 --> M75[\"75. Party Hard<br/>⚠️ MANDATORY $75,000 BUCKME WIRE ⚠️\"]\n254:     end\n255:     \n256:     M75 -->|\"Stage 1 Complete\"| S2_Start\n257:     \n258:     subgraph C4_S2[\"Stage 2: Syndicate Ops (M76 - M82)\"]\n259:         S2_Start[\"76. Heavy Lifting<br/>(Container Smuggling)\"] --> M77[\"77. Photo/Shoot\"]\n260:         M77 --> M78[\"78. Making Gainz\"]\n261:         M78 --> M79[\"79. Watch It\"]\n262:         M79 --> M80[\"80. Cash Injections\"]\n263:         M80 --> M81[\"81. Amateur Hour\"]\n264:         M81 --> M82[\"82. Dirty Work<br/>(Sanitizing Murder Scene)\"]\n265:     end\n266:     \n267:     M82 -->|\"Stage 2 Complete\"| S3_Start\n268:     \n269:     subgraph C4_S3[\"Stage 3: Dre'Quan Climax & Airport Recon (M83 - M91)\"]\n270:         S3_Start[\"83. Too Much Baggage<br/>(Airport Courier Recon)\"]